OL,3,GNEWSAProposal to increase SEND places
OL,4,Aat school
OL,5,
OL,6,FBradford Council is proposing to create
OL,7,F50 additional specialist school places
OL,8,Ffor children with special educational
OL,9,Fneeds and disabilities (SEND) to meet
OL,10,Fgrowing demand.
OL,12,FUnder the plans, Chellow Heights
OL,13,FSpecial School's capacity would
OL,14,Fincrease from 260 to 310 pupils through
OL,15,Fthe establishment of an additional
OL,16,Fsatellite site at Trinity All Saints CE
OL,17,FPrimary School in Bingley.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
