OL,3,GNEWSAProposal to increase SEND places
OL,4,Aat school
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe proposal comes as the number of
OL,7,Fschool-aged children and young people
OL,8,Fwith Education, Health and Care Plans
OL,9,F(EHCPs) in Bradford has increased by
OL,10,Fmore than 150% since 2019, rising from
OL,11,F2,579 to 6,572.
OL,13,FThe proposal is currently subject to
OL,14,Fpublic consultation, with a final
OL,15,Fdecision expected in January 2027.
